# Firebase (FCM) — client config file, kept local-only for now (Firebase's own docs say it's safe to
# commit since it only contains public-facing identifiers, but this project isn't sharing native
# builds across a team yet, so default to not committing it). The FCM V1 service-account private key
# must never be committed regardless of filename — it's uploaded straight to EAS via `eas credentials`,
# never stored in this repo.
/google-services.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
*service-account*.json
